              "source": "HAMAP-Rule",
              "id": "MF_00842"
            }
          ],
          "value": "With TolR probably plays a role in maintaining the position of the peptidoglycan cell wall in the periplasm. Acts as a porin with low permeability that allows slow penetration of small solutes; an internal gate slows down solute passage"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "FUNCTION"
